OL,3,AFour dead and thousands without power
OL,4,Aafter Hurricane Isaias lashes US
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have died and hundreds of
OL,7,Fthousands are without power after
OL,8,FHurricane Isaias battered parts of the
OL,9,Fsouthern US with powerful winds and
OL,10,Fheavy rain.
OL,12,FOfficials reported two deaths each in
OL,13,Fthe states of Alabama and Florida,
OL,14,Fwhich included people who were killed
OL,15,Fwhen trees fell on their houses.
OL,17,FAn estimated 500,000 people in total
OL,18,Fwere without power in several states as
OL,19,Fof Saturday evening, according to
OL,20,Ftracker PowerOutage.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
